# No Cursor commit attribution

Never add any of the following to git commits, commit messages, PRs, or code comments:

- `Co-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>`
- `Co-authored-by: Cursor`
- `Made with Cursor`
- `Made-with: Cursor`

Commits must be authored only as the human developer (Philipp / Lasse). Do not list Cursor as a co-author or contributor.
